# 맵핑 중 지도만 보는 RViz 설정 (SLAM 진행 확인용).
# 주의: RViz에서 저장하면 이 주석은 사라진다.
Panels:
  - Class: rviz_common/Displays
    Name: Displays
  - Class: rviz_common/Tool Properties
    Name: Tool Properties
Visualization Manager:
  Class: ""
  Displays:
    - Class: rviz_default_plugins/Map
      Enabled: true
      Name: Map
      Topic:
        Depth: 1
        Durability Policy: Transient Local
        History Policy: Keep Last
        Reliability Policy: Reliable
        Value: /map
      Update Topic:
        Value: /map_updates
      Use Timestamp: false
      Alpha: 1
      Color Scheme: map
      Draw Behind: false
      Value: true
  Enabled: true
  Global Options:
    Background Color: 48; 48; 48
    Fixed Frame: map
    Frame Rate: 30
  Tools:
    - Class: rviz_default_plugins/MoveCamera
    - Class: rviz_default_plugins/PublishPoint
      Single click: true
      Topic:
        Value: /clicked_point
    - Class: rviz_default_plugins/Select
  Value: true
  Views:
    Current:
      Class: rviz_default_plugins/TopDownOrtho
      Name: Current View
      Target Frame: map
      Scale: 12
      X: -50
      Y: 5
    Saved: ~
Window Geometry:
  Height: 900
  Width: 1400
